# Build output from the host. Copying it in would ship Windows-built binaries
# into a Linux image and confuse the restore layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/

**/.vs/
**/.git/
MigrationBackup/

# Never let a credential into an image layer. Layers are cached, shared and
# survive a later deletion of the file.
**/firebase-service-account.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/appsettings.*.local.json
